  "body": "USB theoretically supports localization of device string descriptors (although I have never actually seen this implemented in practice). However, in the places where the WebUSB specification refers to string descriptors, it does not specify how a LANGID should be chosen.\n\nThis is especially relevant to the `serialNumber` string, since that string is used in permission checks.",
